+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+## Dependencies to install
+
+- `todomvc-common` and `todomvc-app-css` added to `package.json` but not yet installed. Run `npm install` before verifying.
+- `happy-dom` already in devDependencies for headless DOM verification; verify it is installed.
+
+## Watchbill
+
+- `watchbill.json` orders 5 watches: CRUD, completion, editing, routing, persistence+counter.
+- QM should process watches in order.
+
+## Next role
+
+- Dispatch QM after `npm install` and Cucumber step definitions are authored (QM's own job).
+- QM reads features, writes step definitions, dispatches Crew per failing target.
+
+## Open questions
+
+- None. App spec is complete and the template gives the base markup.
