diff --git a/features/todo-completion.feature b/features/todo-completion.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..57e4799
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-completion.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@
+Feature: Todo Completion
+  As a user
+  I want to mark todos as complete or active
+  So that I can track my progress
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: Toggle individual todo completion
+
+  Scenario: Mark a todo as completed by clicking its checkbox
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    When I click the checkbox on "Buy milk"
+    Then "Buy milk" gains the completed class
+    And its checkbox becomes checked
+
+  Scenario: Re-activate a completed todo
+    Given "Buy milk" is marked as completed
+    When I click the checkbox on "Buy milk"
+    Then "Buy milk" loses the completed class
+    And its checkbox becomes unchecked
+
+  Rule: Toggle all todos
+
+  Scenario: Mark all todos as completed via toggle-all
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk" and "Write specs"
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos gain the completed class
+
+  Scenario: Mark all todos as active when toggle-all is unchecked
+    Given all todos are marked as completed
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos lose the completed class
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all reflects individual completion state
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk" and "Write specs"
+    When I click the checkbox on "Buy milk"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox becomes unchecked
+    When I click the checkbox on "Write specs"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox becomes checked
+
+  Rule: Clear completed todos
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes all completed todos
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk" completed and "Write specs" active
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then "Buy milk" is removed from the todo list
+    And "Write specs" remains in the todo list
+
+  Scenario: Clear-completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk" and "Write specs" both active
+    Then the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Clear-completed button is visible when completed todos exist
+    Given "Buy milk" is marked as completed
+    Then the clear-completed button is visible
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/features/todo-counter.feature b/features/todo-counter.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f8153b3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-counter.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,31 @@
+Feature: Todo Counter
+  As a user
+  I want to see the count of active todos
+  So that I know how many tasks remain
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: Active todo counter
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows number of active todos
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk" active and "Write specs" active and "Review code" completed
+    Then the todo-count shows "2"
+
+  Scenario: Counter is wrapped in a strong tag
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    Then the count is wrapped in a <strong> tag
+
+  Rule: Pluralization
+
+  Scenario: Counter uses plural "items" for zero
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    Then the todo-count reads "0 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter uses singular "item" for one
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo-count reads "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter uses plural "items" for more than one
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk" and "Write specs"
+    Then the todo-count reads "2 items left"
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/features/todo-crud.feature b/features/todo-crud.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5b53205
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-crud.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,44 @@
+Feature: Todo CRUD
+  As a user
+  I want to create, view, and delete todos
+  So that I can manage my task list
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: New todo creation
+
+  Scenario: Create a new todo by pressing Enter
+    Given the new-todo input is focused
+    When I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then "Buy milk" appears in the todo list
+    And the new-todo input is cleared
+
+  Scenario: Trim whitespace from new todo title
+    Given the new-todo input is focused
+    When I type "   Write specs   " into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then "Write specs" appears in the todo list
+
+  Scenario: Ignore empty todo on Enter
+    Given the new-todo input is focused
+    When I press Enter with an empty new-todo input
+    Then no new todo is added to the list
+
+  Rule: Todo deletion
+
+  Scenario: Delete a todo by clicking the destroy button
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    When I click the destroy button on "Buy milk"
+    Then "Buy milk" is removed from the todo list
+
+  Rule: Visibility of main and footer sections
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when no todos exist
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer section is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are shown when todos exist
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    Then the main section is visible
+    And the footer section is visible
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/features/todo-editing.feature b/features/todo-editing.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..856dc28
